/* base.rcss - shared HUD theme (fonts, colours, vars). Plan 05 §4.3.
   hud_size / hud_alpha knobs land with batch A; Phase 3 pins the baseline.
   Font faces are loaded natively from C:\Windows\Fonts by rmlui/RmlUiModule
   (Rml::LoadFontFace), so no @font-face rules here - "local()" sources would
   go through the file interface and fail.

   Colour source of truth: the old ABCEnchance scheme (abcenchance/res/
   SchemeBase.res), byte-exact:
     Default (HUD green)      0 255 0 255   -> #00ff00
     Red (danger/empty)     255 0 0 255     -> #ff0000
     HealthBar/ArmorBar bg   255 255 255 125 -> #ffffff7d
     TextMenu bg             0 0 0 64       -> #00000040
     TextMenu text           222 222 222 222 -> #dededede
     DeathMsg item bg        125 125 125 125 -> #7d7d7d7d
     DeathMsg attacker       255 0 0 255     -> #ff0000
     DeathMsg inflictor      255 255 255 255 -> #ffffff
     DeathMsg victim         100 200 130 255 -> #64c882
     Slash (ammo bar)        255 0 0 255     -> #ff0000

   Layout units: dp everywhere - the context density ratio is screenH/480
   (framework::Theme::applyScale), so 1dp equals one old proportional unit.
   Font sizes are the old scheme's 1080p tier expressed in dp (they scale
   proportionally like the layout did). */

body {
	font-family: "Verdana", "Microsoft YaHei";
	font-size: 8.9dp;
	color: #e8e8e8;
}

/* RmlUi ships no HTML user-agent stylesheet: everything defaults to
   display:inline. Give the common text elements their block flow here. */
h1, h2, h3, p, div {
	display: block;
}

h1 {
	font-size: 22px;
	font-weight: bold;
}

/* Old scheme fonts (SchemeBase.res "Fonts" section), 1080p tier in dp.
   Verdana covers latin glyphs; YaHei is the per-glyph CJK fallback. */
.font-hudnum {
	font-family: "Verdana", "Microsoft YaHei";
	font-weight: bold;
	font-size: 14.25dp; /* "HealthBar"/"AmmoBar": 32px @1080p */
}
.font-default {
	font-family: "Verdana", "Microsoft YaHei";
	font-size: 8.9dp; /* "Default": 20px @1080p */
}
.font-defaultsmall {
	font-family: "Verdana", "Microsoft YaHei";
	font-size: 8.9dp; /* "DefaultSmall": 20px @1080p, weight 0 */
}
.font-textmenu {
	font-family: "Verdana", "Microsoft YaHei";
	font-size: 10.7dp; /* "TextMenu": 24px @1080p */
}
.font-uibold {
	font-family: "Tahoma", "Microsoft YaHei";
	font-weight: bold;
	font-size: 4.4dp; /* "UiBold": Tahoma 10px, unscaled in the old scheme */
}
